{'symbol': 'CARR', 'date': '2022-02-06 21:00:00', 'title': "CARRIER SIGNS AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE TOSHIBA'S GLOBAL VRF AND LIGHT COMMERCIAL HVAC BUSINESS", 'text': "PALM BEACH GARDENS, FLA., FEB. 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CARRIER GLOBAL CORPORATION (NYSE: CARR), THE LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF HEALTHY, SAFE, SUSTAINABLE AND INTELLIGENT BUILDING AND COLD CHAIN SOLUTIONS, TODAY SIGNED A BINDING AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE TOSHIBA\xa0CORPORATION'S (TOKYO: 6502) OWNERSHIP STAKE IN TOSHIBA CARRIER CORPORATION (TCC), A VARIABLE REFRIGERANT FLOW (VRF) AND LIGHT COMMERCIAL HVAC JOINT VENTURE WITH CARRIER."}